{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Luna, a girl caught\u00a0in\u00a0a\u00a0fight\u00a0between\u00a0armed\u00a0insurgents\u00a0and\u00a0spies. Help\u00a0her\u00a0navigate\u00a0her\u00a0way\u00a0to\u00a0saving\u00a0her friend. Explore\u00a0a\u00a0laboratory dedicated\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0production\u00a0of\u00a0new\u00a0materials. Acquire and use gadgets. Enjoy\u00a0a\u00a0lighthearted and chaotic story\u00a0of\u00a0a\u00a0girl\u00a0out\u00a0of her depth in\u00a0an espionage mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A visual novel game where you select branching choices and navigate an espionage mission. Select from a variety of choices and unlock new means and methods of completing the mission through the finding and use of various spy gadgets or experimental chemical substances. Play as a teenager thrown into a situation way out of her depth.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640720?t=1744827445","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640720?t=1744827445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640720/53e91cb31b1f2b9c180318e3a230e1b5333943fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744827445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640720/53e91cb31b1f2b9c180318e3a230e1b5333943fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744827445","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Luna, a girl caught\u00a0in\u00a0a\u00a0fight\u00a0between\u00a0armed\u00a0insurgents\u00a0and\u00a0spies. Help\u00a0her\u00a0navigate\u00a0her\u00a0way\u00a0to\u00a0saving\u00a0her friend. Explore\u00a0a\u00a0laboratory dedicated\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0production\u00a0of\u00a0new\u00a0materials. Acquire and use gadgets. Enjoy\u00a0a\u00a0lighthearted and chaotic story\u00a0of\u